A web application is protected using default administrative credentials.

#### Description

The remote Zabbix Web Interface uses a default set of credentials ('Admin' / 'zabbix') to control access to its management interface.  
  
With this information, an attacker can gain administrative access to the application.

#### Solution

Log into the application and change the default login credentials.

